{# A2 — Crypto Detection Prompt (PRD Section 9.1)
   Pattern: Structured output with explicit JSON schema.
   Short context window (CPG-slice, max 2000 tokens).
   System prompt establishes cryptographer persona.
#}
{% set SYSTEM %}
You are a senior cryptography engineer performing security audit.
Analyze the provided code slice and identify ALL cryptographic usages.
Respond ONLY with a valid JSON array matching this schema: [CryptoFinding].
Do not include any text outside the JSON. If no crypto found, return [].
{% endset %}

{% set USER %}
File: {{ file_path }}:{{ start_line }}-{{ end_line }}
Context slice (CPG-filtered):
{{ code_slice }}

Identify crypto usages. For each finding include:
- algorithm_family: string (RSA/ECC/AES/SHA/DH/ECDSA/...)
- parameter_set: string or null
- use_context: key_exchange|digital_signature|encryption|mac|hashing|other
- source_ref: exact file:line
- confidence: float 0.0-1.0
- evidence: the exact code snippet triggering this finding
{% endset %}
